003FCF  1  20 46 25             JSR     LAB_1BFB        ; scan for ")" , else do syntax error then warm start
003FD2  1  A4 95                LDY     Cvaral          ; get var address low byte
003FD4  1  A5 96                LDA     Cvarah          ; get var address high byte
003FD6  1  4C 00 2A             JMP     LAB_AYFC        ; save and convert integer AY to FAC1 and return
