003FD9  1               
003FD9  1               LAB_PI:
003FD9  1  A9 43                LDA     #<LAB_2C7C      ; set (2*pi) pointer low byte
003FDB  1  A0 10                LDY     #>LAB_2C7C      ; set (2*pi) pointer high byte
